<details class="ewt-section ewt-help"><summary>How this is computed</summary><p>Uses the same posted WTP (2307 issued) sources and ATC calculations as 1601-EQ. Draft and void certificates are excluded. Reconcile purchases, payments and manual journals for withholding not represented by an issued certificate.</p><p>First- and second-month 0619-E payments reduce their quarter’s tax. Penalties never become tax credits. A calculated excess is available only to following quarters in the same calendar year; Q4 does not automatically carry into the next year. A refund or TCC election in a saved return blocks that excess from the next quarter. Saved preparation amounts remain unchanged.</p><p><a href="https://bir-cdn.bir.gov.ph/local/pdf/1601-EQ%20January%202019%20ENCS%20final.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener">BIR Form 1601-EQ and instructions</a></p></details>
